        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld sample(s) exceed the 16-bit PCM maximum (peak %@). Exporting would clip them. Normalize those samples on purpose, or replace them. Preview uses the working Float audio."
